        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "They did a check up on my 3 year old daughter. They were absolutely amazing. She was not scared at all cause they kept her calm. Fantastic Experience.",
        "time": 1765216052,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sab Paps",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113399482218442781601/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXRSMbEA0Wg_Ye63Pi3_sYXH4SFrvhigNxe3Is7482DyluV7K86=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "I've been a few times generally nice staff and can be accommodating however I went on a weekend  before and the dentist that I had a younger male and his assistant a latina female complained and told me not to come back on the weekend.  Very disappointing to be told that as if I was a problem to them .",
        "time": 1767724146,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Matt Iversen",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115312209544066650509/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVw7GHJxIxDWj6_PqYE6ZuSgVsVRNJ4YpvuImuaCQcehb1UsBU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "My experience seems out of the norm, but I have since switched clinics due to a lack of trust after two visits and three issues.\n\nClients, do yourselves a favour and ensure that referrals/paperwork are sent out and confirm that it was received. Do not blindly assume that reception has done its job.",
        "time": 1762373308,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nina Lauber",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106378112503365095104/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLOijTMLBMwl_4RIGycFqTsFu5QIlKRoIMb0qUJmGpC0fn_vls=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "After having a bad experience with Dr. Puentes from Dentinella, I had gone for a follow-up with Dr. Terzibachi and Dr. Jean-Daniel Azuelos. They were both amazing and were able to diagnose the root cause of my pain. The dental hygienists and receptionists are super sweet too. Highly recommend 🙂",
        "time": 1766566531,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Claudia Mendoza",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100869478432924451941/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIQ4gKKjaiu0c8s2HCvEuECdFOtEEzMkLmOUaUpscm8DIIE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "I've been going to this clinuque for a couple of years now and I love it. Dr. Qeshta really takes his time to do an amazing job. I really recommend him!",
        "time": 1760170252,
